# The cooked rune belongs to the last pressed key (kbdfs sends c right after
# the k that adds the key and repeats only that key), whatever the rune: an
# a still held does not make Mod+Shift+minus's underscore leak.
defaults
k 61
c 61
k 61 F868
k 61 F868 F016
k 61 F868 F016 2D
c 5F
c 5F
K F868 F016 2D
K F016 2D
K
# a pressed while the chord key is held: its c is forwarded
k F868
k F868 68
c 68
k F868 68 61
c 61
c 61
K F868 68
K F868
K
